static const z_t5698_t _zag53 = { ((uint8_t)Z_T538_TAG_42), 103U, { .data = "USEBEFOREINIT", .size = 13 }, { .data = "used before it is initialised\n\nCode runs top to bottom: a local is in scope from the statement that declares it, and holds a value once that statement is done. A use inside its own value (`n: n + 1`, `point: point x: 10`), or inside a binding's own expression (`for each xs: xs`, `with s: s`), finds the local -- the nearest declaration of the name -- before it holds anything. Name the local differently, or reach the outer declaration through its unit (`system.u64`, `myunit.n`).", .size = 481 } };
